{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act13side_level_act13side_02_end",
  "groupId": "act13side",
  "stageId": "act13side_02",
  "title": "垂死的刺",
  "storyCode": "NL-2",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1da9b00fd6f41829ac4ef2e67db1614fc888c646efa7a3b002bfae8767425cd2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔2 2-2"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "......艾沃娜，你回来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "你脸色很差......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "......当然的吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "没能把那些该死的骑士的甲胄全部打烂......啧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "......不是你的错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "他没有把身体情况告诉我们任何人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "如果是这种程度的感染，几个月前他就不该再继续活动了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "他该想办法离开卡西米尔，按自己的想法，安排好自己最后的时日。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "text": "奥尔默·英格拉......这就是卡瓦莱利亚基的骑士贵族，暴虐、无知、草菅人命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "text": "我就应该在赛场上打断他的四肢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "......也不是你的错，灰毫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "嘁，明明有我跟着......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......他最后......说了什么吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "你不会想知道的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "我希望知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "......好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "text": "感染者死不瞑目......并不是一件稀罕事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "text": "我们会记住他的愤怒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "text": "索娜？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......他叫杰米。是先成为竞技骑士，再因为意外变成感染者的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "离过婚，有个可爱的小女儿。瞒报病情多半是为了能继续作为骑士参赛吧......他需要钱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "但为了瞒报病情......他要给骑士协会更多的钱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "我在他的房间里发现了他与协会成员的信件，那是个无底洞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "他是个很乐观的人，乐观到我们甚至察觉不到他在背负这样的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "就算是感染了矿石病，和妻子孩子都分道扬镳，他也在帮助别人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "你们还记得吗？他每个清晨都会去帮忙照顾那些孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "他不该这么毫无尊严地死去，这和我们建立骑士团的初衷相悖，可是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "可是我在想......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "这样一个对生活满怀热情的人，在最后的最后袒露的是刻骨铭心的仇恨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "如果是这样——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "text": "......索娜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "text": "你最近想的事情太多了，别这么一根筋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "......唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "......这些弯弯绕绕的思考工作就交给你们了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "我要变得更强，强到可以捏碎那些道貌岸然的家伙，强到可以靠自己开辟出一条路来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "血骑士是个不错的榜样，既然卡西米尔如今还愿意认同“骑士”......我们就该这么走下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "别想太多，索娜，那只会让你的速度变慢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "......索娜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "好啦好啦，我知道，我们得加紧和瑟奇亚克确定——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "风......风的响动有变化，虽然只是一瞬间......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "有什么人在盯着这里，而且......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......无胄盟？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "气息隐藏得很好......但如果是敌人的话早就该袭击我们了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "——出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "这里是感染者的地盘，普通人可不会随便跑到这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "否则的话——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "text": "好，好，好，别那么大声，唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "text": "感染者骑士，真是没想过的一道风景。十几年没有靠近过卡瓦莱利亚基，骑士老爷和商人们也真是异想天开......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "text": "......你是谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "text": "别误会，我只是找某些人，凑巧路过这里，不过嘛，相逢即是缘......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "text": "......我想我们应该有些共同话题，各位感染者，例如......无胄盟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "很遗憾，今天我们遭遇了一些不幸的事情，如果真想聊天的话，改日再说吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "text": "是吗？这还真是不凑巧，令人遗憾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "text": "那我只好去别的地方再试试运气啦，毕竟难得来一趟大骑士领。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "text": "那么就不打扰各位啦......但也许我们很快就会再见的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我找到那些带走瑟奇亚克的骑士了......逃走的远牙骑士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "和红松骑士团厮混在一起，当然，感染者骑士具有先天的凝聚力——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "——你那边是什么声音？又在酒吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "好，调查梦魇的背景，不错的借口。关于感染者的命令什么时候下达？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "瑟奇亚克的事情不就是因为“上面还在开会决定”才变成这样的吗？都派过无人机轰炸了，还有什么意义......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "哎呀......就算你和我说，但现在怎么说也是在特锦赛期间，总不能这么轻率地决定吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "嗯，嗯嗯，我真的不是在偷懒，信我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "真的——啊，老板 ，有炸薯条吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "稍等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "好，喂？莫妮克，你还在吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "......哎呀，挂了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "炸薯条，先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "啊，好，多谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "嗯......！是谁想出切片土豆再油炸这种天才般的想法的。现代社会因他而美丽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "说起来，好像之前崭露头角的那位玛莉娅·临光，还有鞭刃骑士也会经常光临这里，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "如果你是想来要个签名，那可能要碰碰运气咯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "毕竟，这家酒吧只能见到一些退役的老家伙罢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "那家伙是谁啊，难道是无胄盟的探子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "天知道，他没动手，我们总不能上去搜身......喂，他是不是在打量你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "唔......别管他得了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "昨晚开始我眼皮就跳得厉害......总感觉有什么大事要发生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "你终于也到了失眠的年纪啦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "啊？我精神得很，你懂什么！当年我就是靠眼皮跳预知到了炮兵师的袭击——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "你能有什么大事？早上挤牙膏挤成橄榄油了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "——唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "马丁。我现在都能感觉到那股气场......是个大人物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "我可从来没有过这么奇怪的预感......但愿不是来惹事的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "（这就来了，速度还挺快......嗯，静观其变好了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——\n——（古老的语言）年轻的猎人，踏上天途♪\n——（古老的语言）从梦里出发，去往黄金的彼岸♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "（这个语言......！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "......怎么回事，现在人来趟酒吧都要自己唱登场曲？那还要点唱机做什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "难道我这个偏僻酒吧真的沾了临光家的光？但我可没有见过你这样的骑士......老弗？你怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "我......我不知道，就是突然心脏有点......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "（古老的语言）......巴特巴雅尔，同胞，末裔之人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "（古老的语言）你为什么在这种地方？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "你......！你知道这个名字？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沉默的骑士环顾四周，视线所及，灯光都在试图避让。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "回答我，你为什么知道那个名字......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "喂老弗，这是你熟人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "要喝点什么吗？客人？如果没什么事的话，这里可能不太欢迎手提兵器的骑士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "（古老的语言）......遗憾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "等等，别急着走——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "科瓦尔，玛莉娅要继续借用你的工坊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "——呃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "佐、佐菲娅姐姐，慢点......呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "怎么突、突然停下，怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......你是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......逐魇骑士？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "崭露头角的本届新星来这里做什么？是来打探玛莉娅和玛嘉烈的情报的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "如果是这样——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "聒噪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "你......你突然做什么！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "......天马......软弱的种族。只有流淌着黄金之血的天马才配称得上对手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "但在天马退位之后，这所谓的“骑士之国”......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "草原在衰弱，你们难道都视而不见吗，库兰塔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "现在的卡西米尔，你们这些人，都被称为骑士吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "都会在那座......浮夸的竞技场上，比拼武艺吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "我很难在你做出刚才的行为后，还老老实实和你对话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "别动......小子，我还有话问你，我可不想现在射穿你的脑袋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "不错......还有战斗的意志。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "那么，你呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "欸，我、我？我就是个路过的骑士粉丝，您高抬贵手，当我不存在就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "我也什么都不会做，什么都不会，嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "（颤铁马丁，善用战锤，弗格瓦尔德，征战骑士的射手，鞭刃骑士，受了伤之后不算什么威胁......玛莉娅，暂时没有关注的必要。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "（但这些其实不关键......嗯......梦魇果然是来找弗格瓦尔德的......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "（好了......接下来......该怎么做呢。耀骑士会来吗？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "......这里不值得停留，与你们为伍，令人坐立难安。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "你小子，看不起谁呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "（古老的语言）巴特巴雅尔，你曾征战沙场，亲临战争，却只是勉强卫护了家园。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "（他在说啥！？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "战争......你是征战骑士？你认识我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "（古老的语言）不，我并不是“骑士”，这太过可笑，只不过，战争是你唯一不曾令先祖蒙羞的行径，末裔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "（古老的语言）即使是在这里......钢筋水泥的城市，阴雨穿过霓虹，末裔，我希望你还记得草原的呼吸与可汗许下的誓言......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "......可汗？啊......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "你在说什么陈芝麻烂谷子的事儿？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "（古老的语言）本想......在再次启程之前，在这所谓的骑士之国寻找残存的同胞，如今看来，是我异想天开。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "（古老的语言）无妨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "（古老的语言）卡西米尔的懦弱是对可汗功绩的不敬，这种行为必须有人去纠正。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "站住！你还没有回答我的问题！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "......嗯，虽然如今已泯然众人，但至少也算半个同胞......我该回答你的问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "......你的名字是一个老兵告诉我的，而他，已经年老体衰，甚至无法奔跑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "我寻找着卡西米尔内的每一个同胞，无论关系多么微弱，只是在寻找同胞而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "哈？同胞？在卡西米尔吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "......已经与你无关了，卡西米尔人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "站住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "逐魇骑士......早听说是个行事乖张的新人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "可是被你这么刀剑相向，我们怎么可能会轻易放你走啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "把头盔摘下来谈话如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "......“逐魇”......？啊，是那群城市的奴隶为我擅自颁发的名号吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "可笑......骑士需要如此在乎名号吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "只因其与生俱来的信仰和对掌握命运的渴望，才催促着骑士踏上旅途。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "你这样寻衅滋事，骑士协会可不会善罢甘休，你想被剥夺特锦赛资格吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "......如果......卡西米尔只剩下你这样无趣的骑士......那我确实在白费力气，无用的资格被剥夺又何妨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "不过，你身边这匹天马......似乎，和我想找的某个人很像......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "......！你是说......姐姐......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "——你找耀骑士想做什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "做什么......？被卡西米尔奉为大骑士的各位冠军——如果说当今的卡西米尔还能有什么值得征服的对手，恐怕就在他们之中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "当然......也可能，他们全都令人失望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "......疯了吧你，你是来找架打的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "（古老的语言）疯了......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "（古老的语言）对......选择活在当下的卡西米尔人，时常这么和我说......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "（古老的语言）......所以我们不再是同胞了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "站住！你想就这么若无其事地离开吗！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "既然此行无果，那也不必久留......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "text": "再会，末裔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......啧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "这家伙是怎么回事，神神叨叨的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "但愿玛嘉烈别在赛场上见到他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "看上去，他就是来看你一眼的？是你老乡吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "他......是梦魇？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "......啊？现在还有活着的梦魇吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "我以为这些人要么活在传说里，要么躲在萨尔贡之类的地方......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "所以呢？你爷爷的爷爷的血亲突然来找你有什么意义？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "............是他在呼唤我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "text": "......啧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "哦！哦！眼前这幅光景，似乎不是第一次出现！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "“左手”泰特斯·白杨，这次能不能带领锋盔骑士团杀出重围，重新回到十六豪强之位！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "此乃复仇之战！观众们！热血沸腾吧！曾多次止步十六强的“左手”泰特斯·白杨，是否能在今天超越自我！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "只因为——他的对手！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "在白杨家族漫长的骑士历史上，只那一次！只那一人！带给了他巨大的耻辱！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "text": "该死......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "text": "......这些年，你到底在做什么......！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "text": "（为什么......见鬼......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "text": "（接下来要怎么打？拉开距离？不，她......嘁......她为什么会用剑枪这类东西......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "text": "（最重要的是......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "text": "（......她竟然......让我感到......压迫？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "泰特斯·白杨闭起了眼。\n他本以为这是一场激昂的复仇，一场酝酿许久的，证明价值的机会。\n但所有的恼怒、愿景与激情，此刻已经烟消云散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他不得不承认，这不是一场对抗。\n只是一次挑战。\n迈向巅峰的挑战。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "text": "（在成为锋盔骑士团的门面之后，我有多久没有这种感觉了......？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "挑战，前进，攀上更高的领域。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "text": "哈......呵呵，我都想笑了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "text": "耀骑士......你真是当年那个你吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "text": "把我逼到这个地步......你却一点不感到自豪，一点也不雀跃？当年那个意气风发的你去哪儿了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "text": "看你现在，你平静得令人作呕——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "我没有小看你的意思，泰特斯，从来没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "但是你已经迷失了方向。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "在那场混乱的围猎中，至少，站到最后的你，和当初只靠一只手臂杀出重围的你，只是纯粹地想要获胜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "text": "哈哈......现在你都学会说教了吗......？难道流放之后的日子，让你变得好为人师了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......泰特斯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "为什么要让那些商标束缚住你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "text": "——耀骑士！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "text": "你不是总把那些腐朽的传统挂在嘴边吗......让我们，用最古老的方式来决一胜负......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "text": "一次冲刺，一次交锋，一次全力以赴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "text": "我要......践踏你的一切！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "左手骑士摆好了架势！是打算用最后的杀招定胜负吗！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "耀骑士这边——耀骑士这边也缓缓举起了那柄奇特的武器——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "究竟在碰撞之后谁才是站到最后的胜利者，还在等什么，观众们！用你们的行动证明你们对骑士的支持吧——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的游客A",
      "text": "烛骑士德罗斯特小姐？她来这里干什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的游客B",
      "text": "不会是在等什么人吧......别愣着啦，快偷偷拍一张......说不定能撞见什么重大绯闻呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "竞技场员工",
      "text": "烛骑士阁下，很抱歉，有失远迎，您是来找谁的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "没关系，是我突然冒昧行动，没有知会你们......我只是想看一看耀骑士的身姿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "比赛，快结束了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "竞技场员工",
      "text": "......是的，左手骑士泰特斯·白杨阁下，在十分钟前输给了耀骑士。虽然泰特斯阁下实力强劲，不过首轮跌入败者组，还是不太乐观......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "......嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "竞技场员工",
      "text": "......您真就只是来见耀骑士一面的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "我想看看，想看看现在的她，和骑士们口口相传的那个她，究竟有多大差别。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "人流全部涌过去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "竞技场员工",
      "text": "是、是的，其实耀骑士正式回归赛场之后，很少会配合我们的运营活动......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "竞技场员工",
      "text": "她经常一言不发地就离开竞技场，安排好的会面和各种宣传事项也会被拒绝，真令人头疼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "竞技场员工",
      "text": "不过，今天好像围绕着耀骑士的记者更多了，这是怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "啊......抱歉，请让一让......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激动的记者",
      "text": "请问玛嘉烈小姐，您如何看待感染者骑士在赛场上身亡的事件？您会因此受到影响吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "抢先的记者",
      "text": "耀骑士阁下，关于骑士协会最近的举措，您有什么要说的吗？感染与否真的会成为不公平的因素？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激动的记者",
      "text": "啊，玛嘉烈小姐，方便透露一下您的感染情况吗？骑士协会对此采取保密措施，是否是对观众与其他骑士的不负责任呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激动的记者",
      "text": "还有人目睹您似乎与几位萨卡兹来往密切，她们是您的什么人？请您做出解释！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "抢先的记者",
      "text": "耀骑士阁下！请您回应——您是否有意成为感染者骑士的精神领袖？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "抢先的记者",
      "text": "——您是否会成为第二个血骑士——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......我不会回答你们的问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激动的记者",
      "text": "您是默认了吗？那您和那些萨卡兹的关系——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "幸会，临光阁下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......您是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激动的记者",
      "text": "......烛骑士德罗斯特！烛骑士在赛场外等着耀骑士！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "抢先的记者",
      "text": "快把赛程表给我......没错，她们之后会在赛场上相遇......喂，快拍下来！拍下来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "我们，能借一步聊聊吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "（您也不想被媒体继续纠缠了吧？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "啊......嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......我明白了，我们换个地方吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "竞技场员工",
      "text": "啊，抱歉，请不要靠太近——媒体问答会在之后另寻时间，请各位稍安勿躁！稍安勿躁！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......那个......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "真辛苦啊，卡西米尔的传奇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "因为您的流放，反而为“耀骑士”蒙上了许多神秘色彩......圣光环绕的骑士，威严的金色天马，如流星般归来的英雄......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "今天靠近一看，您还很年轻，也会为突如其来的状况困扰......玛嘉烈·临光，是这样一个活生生的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......无论如何，都感谢您刚才的帮助。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "您是一名骑士吧，不知道您是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "......已经挺久没有人问我是谁了，比起我是谁，他们更在意的是他们希望我是谁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "呃，很抱歉，我回到卡西米尔的时间不长......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "......呵呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "您觉得......我会因为您不认识我，而恼羞成怒吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "看得出，您与众不同。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "哎呀，感谢您的夸奖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "我也很高兴认识这样的耀骑士，我的名字是薇薇安娜·德罗斯特。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "或者，您也可以称呼我为烛骑士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "烛骑士......不，德罗斯特小姐，再次感谢您今天的帮助，您找我是有什么事吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "我们不久后会在赛场上相见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "您是一名感染者，是一名一度遭到流放的人......别误会，我不是个经常喜欢在赛前与对手沟通的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "我来自莱塔尼亚，在异国他乡，以一个从未想过的身份，活在这座繁华的城市里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "您已经得到了卡西米尔的认可，德罗斯特小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "我听说，耀骑士从未认可过如今的骑士制度，也因此，您遭到了流放......您如今还是这么想吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "卡西米尔的骑士正在遗忘他们的职责。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "您去过卡西米尔最贫苦的地方吗？战争、饥荒、感染者......百姓遭受着巨大的苦难，骑士们躲在自己的城市里歌舞升平。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "骑士的精神，已经消失殆尽，成为了资本肆意操弄的遗产。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "这难道不是一种耻辱吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "......原来如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "看起来，您才是一名真正的骑士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "但您......仍只是一名骑士而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "您的妹妹呢？先前一段时间，是她活跃在赛场上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "她放弃了......骑士之路吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "............",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "德罗斯特小姐......还有玛嘉烈小姐，晚上好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "晚上好，麦基先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "刚才的骚动劳您费神了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "......唉。原来您有这个自觉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "像二位这样的大骑士，一举一动都会成为群众热衷的话题，何况，你们还当着媒体的面......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "不过这都算了，总是有办法处理的，德罗斯特小姐，您该为明天与莱塔尼亚贵族的会面做准备。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "可以的话，这段时间还是不要制造太多不确定因素的好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "比如，和一位感染者骑士见面？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "......那位贵族几乎可以说是为您而来，德罗斯特小姐。您在莱塔尼亚人之间也人气斐然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "梅什科工业很乐意帮助对方在莱塔尼亚的建设计划，但最终推行贸易合同的人，是您，德罗斯特小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "当然......我的职责。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "看来很遗憾，耀骑士阁下，今夜没法和您继续交谈了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "没关系，您......让人很意外，如今的卡西米尔还有您这样的骑士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "下回见，就是在赛场上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "我等待着那一天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烛骑士",
      "text": "......最后一句忠告，耀骑士阁下。",
      "portraitKey": null
